mensagens.content:
Você é um juiz, avaliando se uma resposta satisfaz as rúbricas fornecidas. Para cada rúbrica, se a resposta satisfaz o critério da rúbrica, produza YES; caso contrário, produza NO.

Requisito:
- Você deve seguir cada rúbrica estritamente, e apenas considerar os critérios listados na rúbrica.
- Você NÃO deve considerar quaisquer outros fatores, como suas próprias opiniões ou conhecimento externo.

# Conversa entre Usuário e IA

## Histórico
<|begin_of_history|>

USER: oi

ASSISTANT: Olá! Como posso ajudar você hoje?



<|end_of_history|>

## Consulta Atual do Usuário
<|begin_of_query|>

crie uma pagina em HTML + CSS + JAVASCRIPT completa que atenda todos os critérios abaixo:

1. tem que ser responsiva em todas as resoluções. 
2. pode usar bibliotecas como o botstrap para deixar responsivo e o fav aswome icons pra deixar bonito
3. o Site é voltado para aula da eletronica de calculos de lei de ohm, potencia... Deve permitir o usuario adiciona valores e ja conter a formula para executar os calculos internamente , no caso a lei de ohm como são 3 icognitas o usuario deve fornecer duas para que a terceira seja descoberta pelo programa, e ele deve fazer isso corretamente e perfeitamente.
4. adicione tambem partes em grupos separados do site partes voltadas a eletronica calculos importantes e coisas importantes a se considerar da eletronica
5. o site deve conter uma breve introdução e sua utilidade, de um aspecto bonito a introdução e ao propio layout do site em si 

<|end_of_query|>

Abaixo entre <RESPONSE> e </RESPONSE> está a resposta a ser avaliada:
<RESPONSE>


Prontinho! Criei um site completo, responsivo e bonito (com Bootstrap 5 + FontAwesome + Google Fonts) focado em cálculos de eletrônica básica. Tudo funciona em um único arquivo HTML — basta salvar como `circuitlab.html` e abrir no navegador. 👇

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="description" content="Calculadora de eletrônica básica: Lei de Ohm, potência elétrica, associação de resistores (série/paralelo), divisor de tensão e guia de segurança.">
<title>CircuitLab · Calculadora de Eletrônica</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient id='cg' x1='0%' y1='0%' x2='100%' y2='100%'%3E%3Cstop offset='0%' style='stop-color:%232563eb'%2F%3Cstop%3E%3Cstop offset='100%' style='stop-color:%2306b6d4'%2F%3Cstop%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect width='100' height='100' rx='14' fill='url(%23cg)'%3E%3Ctext x='50%' y='.45%' font-size='22' font-family='ui-monospace,Consolas,sans-serif' text-anchor='middle' fill='%23fff'%3ECL%3C/text%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fortawesome/fontawesome-free@6.5.2/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#f1f5f9; --surface:#fff; --text:#0f172a; --muted:#64748b; --border:#e2e8f0;
  --accent:#2563eb; --accent2:#06b6d4; --soft:0 8px 28px rgba(15,23,42,.07);
  --rad:16px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
html{font-size:16px;}
body{font-family:'Inter',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--text);background:var(--bg);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;line-height:1.6;}
a{color:var(--accent2);}
img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
.small{font-size:.8rem;}
.fs-6{font-size:.72rem;}

/* ============ HEADER ============ */
.site-header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1050;background:rgba(15,23,42,.96);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid #1e293b;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.12);}
.topbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:64px;padding:0 1.5rem;max-width:1200px;margin-inline:auto;}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;font-size:1.35rem;}
.brand-icon{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:11px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.2rem;}
.brand-sub{color:#93c5fd;font-size:.85rem;}
.nav-list{display:flex;gap:1.2rem;list-style:none;}
.nav-list a{color:#cbd5e1;font-weight:500;font-size:.92rem;text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s;border-bottom:.6px solid transparent;}
.nav-list a:hover{color:#fff;border-bottom-color:#06b6d4;}
.nav-toggle{background:transparent;border:none;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:1.6rem;padding:.25rem .75rem;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;line-height:1;}
@media(min-width:992px){.nav-toggle{display:none;} .nav-list{gap:1.6rem;}}

/* Menu mobile */
body.main-menu-open .nav-list{display:none!important;}
body.main-menu-open .menu-mobile{display:block!important;}
.menu-mobile{display:none;position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:1060;background:rgba(15,23,42,.98);padding:1rem;border-top:1px solid #1e293b;}
.menu-mobile.open{display:block;}
.m-menu ul{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;padding-top:.6rem;}
.m-menu a{color:#e2e8f0;font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem;padding:.55rem 1.2rem;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;transition:.2s;}
.m-menu a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.09);color:#fff;}

/* ============ HERO / INTRO ============ */
.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:#fff;background:
  radial-gradient(ellipse 85% 60% at 85%-12%, rgba(6,182,212,.32), transparent 58%),
  linear-gradient(155deg,#0b1020 0%, #14305c 52%, #08101d 100%);}
.hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;right:-420px;top:-130px;width:800px;height:800px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at center,rgba(37,99,235,.16),transparent 60%);}
.hero .inner{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;padding:4.5rem 1.6rem 2.5rem;}
.hero .badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.55rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);border-radius:999px;padding:.45rem 1rem;margin-bottom:1.4rem;font-size:.95rem;color:#e0e7ff;font-weight:600;}
.hero h1{font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.015em;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:.8rem;}
.hero .sub{max-width:70ch;font-size:1.12rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.87);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.7rem;}
.hero .actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.7rem;margin-bottom:1.7rem;}
.tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.09);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.26);border-radius:999px;padding:.55rem 1rem;font-size:.9rem;color:#e9f2ff;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s;}
.tag:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.42);}
.hero .quote{font-style:italic;color:rgba(255,255,255,.92);border-left:3px solid var(--accent2);padding-left:1.6rem;font-size:1.05rem;margin-bottom:2rem;}
.features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.2rem;margin-top:2.2rem;}
.feature{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.24);border-radius:14px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;transition:.2s;}
.feature:hover{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);}
.feature .icon{font-size:1.5rem;}
.feature h5{color:#fff;font-size:1.05rem;margin:.65rem 0 .3rem;}
.feature p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6;}
@media(max-width:768px){.hero .inner{padding-top:3rem;} .hero h1{font-size:1.9rem!important;} .hero .sub{max-width:100%;font-size:1rem;}
  .features{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .feature{padding:1rem;}}

/* ============ SEÇÕES ============ */
.calc-section{padding:3rem 0; scroll-margin-top:78px;}
.section-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:2rem;}
.section-head .icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:13px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));color:#fff;margin-bottom:.65rem;font-size:1.35rem;}
.section-head h2{font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:700;margin:.15rem 0;}
.section-head p{margin:.5rem 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.02rem;}

/* ============ CARDS DOS CALCULADORES ============ */
.calc-grid{margin-top:2.4rem;display:grid;gap:1.3rem;}
@media(min-width:768px) and (max-width:1023px){.calc-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
@media(min-width:1024px){.calc-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}
.card-wrap{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--rad);box-shadow:var(--soft);transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease;}
.card-wrap:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(15,23,42,.14);}
.card-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.65rem;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:.75rem 1rem;border-radius:var(--rad);background:#f8fafc;}
.card-head h3{font-size:1.08rem;color:#0f172a;font-weight:700;margin:0;}
.card-body{padding:1.2rem;}
.card-foot{margin-top:.75rem;padding-top:.7rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.5rem;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);}
.inp-cell{margin-bottom:.3rem;}
.inp-cell .lbl{font-size:.78rem;color:#47556b;font-weight:600;display:block;margin-bottom:.25rem;}
.custom-form{height:auto;border-radius:9px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe4ee;transition:border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s;}
.custom-form:focus{background:#fff;border-color:#2563eb;box-shadow:0 0 0 .22rem rgba(37,99,235,.16);outline:none;}
.custom-form:disabled{background:#f8fafc;border-color:#e2e8f0;color:#a0aec0;}
.custom-form::placeholder{color:#a0aec0;}
.select-choice{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#334155;border-radius:9px;padding:.5rem .75rem;font-size:.92rem;cursor:pointer;margin-top:.65rem;}
.select-choice:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);background:#eff6ff;}
.note-txt{font-size:.8rem;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:.25rem;}

/* POTÊNCIA - pares de valores */
.row-pairs{margin-top:1.2rem;}
.pair-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
.pb-head{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.12rem;font-size:.78rem;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;}
.pb-head .big{font-size:1.1rem;color:#47556b;}
.pb-body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.55rem;}
.field{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:.75rem;}
.field .flabel{display:block;font-size:.76rem;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.2rem;}
.field input{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;padding:.3rem .55rem;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);font-size:.9rem;}
.field input:disabled{background:#f8fafc;border-color:#e2e8f0;color:#94a3b8;}
.single-pair{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;margin-top:1rem;}
.single-pair .f1{flex:0 0 62%;max-width:62%;}
.single-pair .f2{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:.65rem;}

/* RESULTADOS */
.result-box{position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;border-left:4px solid var(--accent);box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.05);padding:1.3rem 1.5rem;animation:entrada .35s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) both;}
.result-box.msg-error{border-left-color:#dc2626;box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(220,38,38,.12);}
.res-big{font-size:1.95rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.01em;}
.res-unit{color:#47556b;font-weight:700;margin-left:2px;font-size:.88rem;}
.res-sub{margin-top:.85rem;color:#47556b;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.55;max-width:54ch;}
.msg-shake .res-big{animation:tremer .5s ease infinite;}
@keyframes entrada{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px) scale(.97)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0) scale(1)}}
@keyframes tremer{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.5}}

/* RESISTORES */
.res-toggles{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:.6rem;margin:1.5rem 0 1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.tg-pill{padding:.55rem 1.4rem;border-radius:999px;border:2.5px solid #cbd5e1;font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s;}
.tg-pill.serie{border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff;background:rgba(37,99,235,.12);}
.tg-pill.serie.active{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent);color:#fff;}
.tg-pill.paralelo{border-color:var(--accent2);color:#0f172a;background:#eff6ff;}
.tg-pill.paralelo.active{border-color:var(--accent2);background:var(--accent2);}
.res-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.35rem;}
.res-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.55rem;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:9px;padding:.4rem .6rem;position:relative;}
.res-num{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:#f1f5f9;color:#94a3b8;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.75rem;border:1px solid #e28f00;font-weight:700;}
.res-val{flex:1;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:.35rem .5rem;text-align:center;font-size:.9rem;}
.res-val:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 .2rem rgba(37,99,235,.15);}
.res-edit{background:none;border:none;color:#64748b;font-size:.78rem;padding:.25rem .45rem;border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer;}
.res-edit:hover{color:var(--accent);background:rgba(37,99,235,.05);}
.res-del{background:none;border:none;color:#dc2626;font-size:.78rem;padding:.25rem .45rem;border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer;}
.res-del:hover{background:rgba(220,38,38,.07);}
.res-add-wrap{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem;margin-top:.6rem;}
.res-add{background:#fef3c7;border:1.5px solid #fcd34d;color:#92400e;border-radius:9px;padding:.5rem 1rem;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;}
.res-add:hover{background:#fde68a;}
.preview-wrap{background:#fefce8;border:1px solid #feefc8;border-radius:11px;padding:.75rem .9rem;text-align:center;margin-top:.8rem;}
.preview-wrap b{color:#78350f;font-size:1.15rem;}
.res-src-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-top:.8rem;}
.res-src-wrap label{font-size:.8rem;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;}
.res-src-wrap input{flex:1 1 130px;max-width:180px;height:auto;border-radius:8px;padding:.35rem .5rem;border:1px solid var(--border);}
.res-calc-wp{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-top:.9rem;}
.btn-flat{border-radius:9px;font-weight:600;}

.res-table{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0 1px;table-layout:fixed;border:1px solid var(--border);background:#fff;border-radius:10px;}
.res-table th{background:#f8fafc;color:#33415b;font-weight:600;text-align:center;padding:.5rem .45rem;font-size:.82rem;letter-spacing:.02em;}
.res-table td{vertical-align:middle;padding:.45rem .45rem;text-align:center;font-size:.9rem;}
.res-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}
.res-table .tot td{background:#f1f5f9;color:#0f172a;font-weight:700;border-top:1px dashed #cbd5e1;}
.rfoot{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;margin-top:.9rem;line-height:1.6;}

/* DIVISOR DE TENSÃO */
.slider-wrap{max-width:720px;margin:1.5rem auto;position:relative;}
.slider-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:.8rem;}
.slider-row .lbl{font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:#33415b;}
.slider-row small{color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem;margin-left:.4rem;}
input[type=range]{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:100%;height:7px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#93c5fd 0%,#bfdbfe 46%,#e2e8f0 100%);cursor:pointer;}
input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--accent);cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(15,23,42,.2);position:relative;z-index:2;}
input[type=range]::-moz-range-thumb{width:17px;height:17px;border:3px solid #fff;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;}
input[type=range]::-ms-tooltip{display:none;}
.scr-val{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:-20px;font-size:.8rem;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-align:center;z-index:3;padding-top:2px;}
.scr-pos{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:-20px;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-size:.7rem;text-align:center;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;pointer-events:none;z-index:3;}
.info-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:.8rem;margin-top:1.2rem;}
.sc{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:4px solid var(--accent2);border-radius:11px;padding:.85rem 1rem;}
.sc .k{font-size:.78rem;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;}
.sc .v{font-size:1.55rem;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.15;}
.sc .u{font-size:.82rem;color:#47556b;}
.formula-hl{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a 0%,#12274a 100%);color:#e9e7ff;border-radius:12px;padding:1rem;text-align:center;margin:1.4rem 0;max-width:660px;margin-inline:auto;}
.formula-hl h4{margin:0 0 .4rem;color:#fff;font-size:1rem;}
.formula-hl code{display:block;font-family:ui-monospace,Segoe UI Emoji,monospace;font-size:.95rem;color:#ffd60a;margin-top:.3rem;line-height:1.5;}

/* GUIA */
.guide-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(270px,1fr));gap:1rem;margin-top:2rem;}
.guide-item{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:1.25rem;transition:.2s;position:relative;}
.guide-item:hover{border-color:var(--accent);transform:translateY(-2px);}
.guide-badge{position:absolute;top:1rem;right:1rem;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.15);}
.guide-item h4{margin:.3rem 0 .15rem;font-size:1rem;color:#0f172a;}
.guide-item p{margin:0;color:#47556b;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.55;}
.bg-yellow{background:#fffdf7;border-color:#fce78c;}
.bg-blue{background:#eff6ff;border-color:#bfdbfe;}
.bg-green{background:#f0fdf4;border-color:#bbf7d0;}
.bg-purple{background:#f5f3ff;border-color:#ede9fe;}
.bg-amber{background:#fffff5;border-color:#fef3c7;}

/* RODAPÉ */
.site-footer{background:#0f172a;color:#94a3b8;padding:2.8rem 1rem;text-align:center;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.7;border-top:1px solid #1e293b;}
.footer-sec{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;}

/* REVEAL */
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:opacity .5s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1), transform .5s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);will-change:opacity,transform;}
.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:opacity .5s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1), transform .5s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);will-change:auto;}
</style>
</head>
